



     APX-Hosted i860(TM) CPU NATIVE BASIC SOFTWARE Package Release(N1.3)

1. INTRODUCTION

The 2 diskettes contain the i860(TM) APX Native Basic Software, version N1.3.
The programs on these diskettes execute on the i860(TM) Microprocessor in an
APX environment and generate object files and binaries for the i860(TM)
Microprocessor.

2. CONTENTS

The package has two directories at the top: 

        doc: Contains this readme.b file:
	bin: Contains the following basic tools:

        1.    as860		i860(TM) Assembler

        2.    ld860	 	i860(TM) Linker.

        3.    sim860		i860(TM) Simulator.

        4.    mac860		i860(TM) Macro Preprocessor.

        5.    mas860		i860(TM) Macro Assembler.

        6.    ar860,lib860      i860(TM) Librarian.

	      NOTE: The Librarian is called ar860 in the AIX / UNIX
	      package and it it is called lib860 in the OS/2 package.
    
        7.    dump860	        These three utilities are
        8.    size860           i860(TM) Object File Utilities.
        9.    nm860,name860      

	      NOTE: The Name Utility is called nm860 in the AIX / UNIX
	      package and it is called name860 in the OS/2 package.
       
    The documentation for all the tools is included in the i860 software 
development manual provided with this release. Please refer to the same for
more information.

3. INSTALLATION
 	
    To install this software onto your system please refer to the 
Installation Instruction Supplement provided with this release.










